    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Ericsson LM Telephone Co is a for-profit public company headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden, and trades under the ticker ERIC. Its website describes the company as powering the networks that connect billions, with work spanning 5G, AI-driven automation, and cloud-based enterprise connectivity. The site discusses 6G as an \"intelligent fabric\" that connects people and machines through mobile, cloud, and AI systems, and highlights network slicing, orchestration, and AI-driven tools for connectivity.\n\nThe company's site positions connectivity as a strategic advantage as AI moves into the physical world, and describes communications and connectivity solutions that combine 5G, AI, and cloud for productivity, scalability, and resilience. It also references an Open Radio Access Network (Open RAN) transformation with AT&T as a foundation for an open, disaggregated, and programmable network with automation.\n\nThe company is registered with the SEC under Central Index Key 0000717826. Alternate names include ERICSSON (LM) TEL-SP ADR. No lawsuits are on record for the company.",
